\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {16}{\ignorespaces 2021 mass-resolution summary used for the prompt analysis. The red curve is the inclusive target-constrained V0 quadratic fit without hit requirements before the TC data/MC broadening in Eq.\nobreakspace  {}\ref  {eq:sigma2021-tc-smear}. The blue curve shows the corresponding unconstrained V0 reference fit included in the underlying study for comparison.\relax }}{25}{figure.caption.18}\protected@file@percent }
